   <media:title>Cher. Pioneering Genres &amp; Generations</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/2SsjNbP1MTU?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/2SsjNbP1MTU/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Moncler Re/Icons celebrates the enduring spirit of pioneering icons. Cher ponders her highest mountains climbed and takes in the view from the top. 

“My biggest mountain climbed? I'm still doing it. It's not easy to get on top, but it's a b*tch to stay on top. So, staying is my biggest triumph.”

Cher defied all odds to not only reach the pinnacle, but to stay there. Refusing to be defined by others, she has spent decades harnessing reinvention and embracing evolution, leaping across the boundaries of music, film and fashion to continuously shape global style and command pop culture’s attention. Bridging past and future, iconic heritage with modern edge, she embodies a spirit of timeless innovation and defiant authenticity. A powerful testament to those who dare to lead rather than follow, Cher’s pioneering spirit transcends age, limits and boundaries, uniting generations through a shared vision of bold, authentic self-expression.</media:description>
